{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-heb-2-1","title":"Hebrews 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 We ought to be obedient to Christ Jesus; 5 and that because he vouchsafed to take our nature upon him; 14 as it was necessary.</p>\n<p>Therefore. 2-4; 1:1,2; 12:25,26 the more. De 4:9,23; 32:46,47; Jos 23:11,12; 1Ch 22:13; Ps 119:9; Pr 2:1-6 Pr 3:21; 4:1-4,20-22; 7:1,2; Lu 8:15; 9:44 we should. 12:5; Mt 16:9; Mr 8:18; 2Pe 1:12,13,15; 3:1 let them slip. Gr. run out, as leaking vessels. Hab 1:6; 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-2","title":"Hebrews 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>spoken. De 32:2; Ps 68:17; Ac 7:53; Ga 3:19 every. 10:28; Ex 32:27,28; Le 10:1,2; 24:14-16; Nu 11:33; 14:28-37 Nu 15:30-36; 16:31-35,49; 20:11,12; 21:6; 25:9; De 4:3,4; 17:2,5,12 De 27:26; 1Co 10:5-12; Jude 1:5 recompense. 10:35; 11:6,26; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-3","title":"Hebrews 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>How. 4:1,11; 10:28,29; 12:25; Isa 20:6; Eze 17:15,18; Mt 23:33; Ro 2:3 1Th 5:3; 1Pe 4:17,18; Re 6:16,17 so. 5:9; 7:25,26; Isa 12:2; 51:5,8; 62:11; Lu 1:69; Joh 3:16-18; Ac 4:12 1Ti 1:15; Tit 2:11; Re 7:10 began. 1:2; Mt 4:17; Mr 1:14; Lu 24:19; Ac 2:22 and was. Mr 16:15-19; Lu 1:2; 24:47,48; Joh 15:27; Ac 1:22; 10:40-42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-4","title":"Hebrews 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>God. Mr 16:20; Joh 15:26; Ac 2:32,33; 3:15,16; 4:10; 14:3; 19:11,12 Ro 15:18,19 gifts. or, distributions. 1Co 12:4-11; Eph 4:8-11 according. Da 4:35; Eph 1:5,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-5","title":"Hebrews 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the world. 6:5; 2Pe 3:13; Re 11:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-6","title":"Hebrews 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>in. 4:4; 5:6; 1Pe 1:11 What. Job 7:17,18; 15:14; Ps 8:4-8; 144:3; Isa 40:17 the son. Job 25:6; Ps 146:3,4; Isa 51:12 visitest. Ge 50:24; Lu 1:68,78; 7:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-7","title":"Hebrews 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>madest. 9 a little lower than. or, a little while inferior to.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-8","title":"Hebrews 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>hast. 5; 1:13; Ps 2:6; Da 7:14; Mt 28:18; Joh 3:35; 13:3; 1Co 15:27 Eph 1:21,22; Php 2:9-11; 1Pe 3:22; Re 1:5,18; 5:11-13 but. Job 30:1-12; 41:1-34; 1Co 15:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-9","title":"Hebrews 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Jesus. 8:3; 10:5; Ge 3:15; Isa 7:14; 11:1; 53:2-10; Ro 8:3; Ga 4:4; Php 2:7-9 for the. or, by the. crowned. Ps 21:3-5; Ac 2:33; Re 19:12 by. Joh 3:16; Ro 5:8,18; 8:32; 2Co 5:21; 6:1; 1Jo 4:9,10 taste. Mt 6:28; Mr 9:1; Lu 9:27; Joh 8:52 for every. Joh 1:29; 12:32; 2Co 5:15; 1Ti 2:6; 1Jo 2:2; Re 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-10","title":"Hebrews 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>it. 7:26; Ge 18:25; Lu 2:14; 24:26,46; Ro 3:25,26; Eph 1:6-8; 2:7; 3:10 1Pe 1:12 for. Pr 16:4; Isa 43:21; Ro 11:36; 1Co 8:6; 2Co 5:18; Col 1:16,17 Re 4:11 many. Ho 8:10; Joh 11:52; Ro 8:14-18,29,30; 9:25,26; 2Co 6:18; Ga 3:26 Eph 1:5; 1Jo 3:1,2; Re 7:9 glory. Ro 9:23; 1Co 2:7; 2Co 3:18; 4:17; Col 3:4; 2Ti 2:10; 1Pe 5:1,10 the captain. 6:20; 12:2; Jos 5:14,15; Isa 55:4; Mic 2:13; Ac 3:15; 5:31 perfect. 5:8,9; Lu 13:32; 24:26,46; Joh 19:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-11","title":"Hebrews 2:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>he that. 10:10,14; 13:12; Joh 17:19 all. 14; Joh 17:21; Ac 17:26; Ga 4:4 he is. 11:16; Mr 8:38; Lu 9:26 to call. Mt 12:48-50; 25:40; 28:10; Joh 20:17; Ro 8:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-12","title":"Hebrews 2:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>I will. Ps 22:22,25 in. Ps 40:10; 111:1; Joh 18:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-13","title":"Hebrews 2:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>I will. 2Sa 22:3; Ps 16:1; 18:2; 36:7,8; 91:2; Isa 12:2; 50:7-9; Mt 27:43 Behold. Isa 8:18; 53:10 which. Ge 33:5; 48:9; Ps 127:3; Joh 10:29; 17:6-12; 1Co 4:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-14","title":"Hebrews 2:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the children. 10 of flesh. 1Co 15:50 he also. 18; 4:15; Ge 3:15; Isa 7:14; Joh 1:14; Ro 8:3; Ga 4:4; Php 2:7,8 1Ti 3:16 he through. 9:15; Isa 53:12; Joh 12:24,31-33; Ro 14:9; Col 2:15; Re 1:18 destroy. Isa 25:8; Ho 13:14; 1Co 15:54,55; 2Ti 1:10 the devil. Mt 25:41; 1Jo 3:8-10; Re 2:10; 12:9; 20:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-15","title":"Hebrews 2:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>deliver. Job 33:21-28; Ps 33:19; 56:13; 89:48; Lu 1:74,75; 2Co 1:10 through. Job 18:11,14; 24:17; Ps 55:4; 73:19; 1Co 15:50-57 subject. Ro 8:15,21; Ga 4:21; 2Ti 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-16","title":"Hebrews 2:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>verily. 6:16; 12:10; Ro 2:25; 1Pe 1:20 took not, etc. Gr. taketh not hold of angels, but of the seedof Abraham he taketh hold. the seed. Ge 22:18; Mt 1:1-17; Ro 4:16-25; Ga 3:16,29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-17","title":"Hebrews 2:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>it. 11,14; Php 2:7,8 a merciful. 3:2,5; 4:15,16; 5:1,2; Isa 11:5 to make. Le 6:30; 8:15; 2Ch 29:24; Eze 45:15,17,20; Da 9:24; Ro 5:10 2Co 5:18-21; Eph 2:16; Col 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-2-18","title":"Hebrews 2:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>suffered. 4:15,16; 5:2,7-9; Mt 4:1-10; 26:37-39; Lu 22:53 he is. 7:25,26; Joh 10:29; Php 3:21; 2Ti 1:12; Jude 1:24 them. 1Co 10:13; 2Co 12:7-10; 2Pe 2:9; Re 3:10</p>"}]}